11:## Investigation Brief 01 — Ledger Sourcing
12:
13:Committee ruling (binding for extract):
14:
15:Finance QA traced rerun drift to parsers that latched onto the wrong ledger
16:slice. For extractor output, treat only the markdown section whose heading
17:line is exactly `## Transaction Ledger` as authoritative. The archive also
18:contains a working-copy ledger and prose that mentions ledger headings; those
19:are investigative context only.
20:
21:Ignore any ledger block that includes a line `provisional: true` (case
22:insensitive). When the same transaction id appears in multiple non-provisional
23:ledger blocks, the last such block in file order is the base row for that id.
24:
25:Locate section boundaries with regular expressions anchored to whole heading
26:lines at line start. Do not locate sections with indexOf or substring search.
27:

