=== Brief 07: lines 1201-1212 (show first ~220 lines) ===
1201:## Investigation Brief 07 — Exception Flags (Part I)
1202:
1203:Extract policy (authoritative):
1204:
1205:Exception coding review: `exception_reason` is null unless a code applies. Set
1206:`over_limit` when `amount_usd` strictly exceeds 10000. Set `compliance_hold`
1207:when final status is `rejected`, a qualifying `compliance@` email referenced
1208:that transaction, and that email block includes a `sent:` line. The sent-date
1209:comparison used for `compliance_hold` is defined in Investigation Brief 09
1210:(Mid-Year Amendment), not Brief 03. Multiple reasons join with semicolon in
1211:lexical order of the reason codes.
1212:

